  "description": "MiniMax H3 text-to-video sped up with the Turbo LoRA + matching 4-step dual-schedule sampler from larryvrh/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora — cuts sampling from ~20 steps to ~6-8 while keeping audio in sync. Early prototype weights (author's own description) but already sharper than the base model at low step counts. Same base MiniMax H3 checkpoint/text-encoder/VAE as SimpliGen's official MiniMax H3 pack, so no extra large downloads beyond the ~744MB LoRA.",
  "tags": ["Local", "Video", "T2V", "MiniMax H3", "Turbo", "LoRA"],
