      "description": "Describe a scene and get video with matching stereo sound, sped up via a Turbo LoRA + custom 4-step dual-schedule sampler (video and audio step on separate schedules so audio doesn't break at low step counts). Early prototype weights - treat output quality as a work in progress, not final.",
